Beefree template fixtures

The files in this folder are third-party Beefree templates (and, where named, Beefree's HTML export of them), kept
unchanged as test fixtures for the Beefree converter in @unlayer/migrate. They are not covered by this repository's MIT
license: each keeps the license of the repository it comes from, listed below.

